        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "The LB is itself a **single point of failure**",
            "active/passive: ==VRRP== floats the VIP, standby idles",
            "active/active: ==ECMP anycast== across many LB nodes",
            "Losing one node rehashes only its share (p8)"
          ],
          "style": "star",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Clients cache records **past** the TTL",
            "No health awareness: dead IP still handed out",
            "No weights, so a 2x box gets a 1x share",
            "Resolvers quietly clamp short TTLs upward"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        }
      ],
      "hero": "elb",
