        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "6. Mistakes",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==Herd effect==: N independent LBs all see the new node at **0 conns** and dogpile it",
            "Fix: P2C (each LB samples differently) or slow start",
            "No ==slow start==: cold JIT and empty caches meet full traffic, p99 spikes",
            "Modulo hash instead of consistent hash: a pool change reshuffles **everyone**"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "Defaults",
          "text": "LC for general HTTP. P2C when many LB instances share one pool. Consistent hash only when cache locality or affinity pays for the uneven load."
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Active probe kinds: `TCP connect`, `HTTP GET /healthz`, scripted exchange",
            "Passive (__outlier detection__): connect errors, 5xx rate, timeouts",
            "Passive catches death **fast** under load; active detects {green:recovery}",
            "Only active covers an __idle__ backend with no traffic to judge"
          ],
          "style": "dot"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Detection ≈ ==interval × unhealthy==. `5s × 3 = ~15s` of **blackholing** before eject.",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        }
      ],
