          }
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "Reverse order drops requests",
          "text": "Stop accepting **before** failing readiness and the LB keeps routing to a closed socket — instant 502s. Page 9 covers that failure."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Definition",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "==Affinity== binds a client to __one backend__ for a session's life, so {green:server-local state} — in-memory session, upload buffer, websocket — stays reachable.",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Mechanisms",
          "ink": "blue"
